Original work
-------------
The exporter, importer-es and importer-rdbms modules began as the
ph-ee-exporter, ph-ee-importer-es and ph-ee-importer-rdbms projects, written by
DPC Consulting and contributed to the Mifos Initiative
(https://github.com/openMF/ph-ee-exporter, ph-ee-importer-es,
ph-ee-importer-rdbms). Their Java packages were originally under hu.dpc.
importer-rdbms was moved to org.mifos.phee.operator in 2026; the original
authors keep the copyright in their work.

